ind":"announcement","title":"We're in the mix!","summary":"Night Machine launches December 2ndTrainee!! the wait is almost over. Night Machine releases on Steam on December 2nd, and between now and then we have a lot to show you. New trailer at The Mix Fall ShowcaseWe're taking part in The Mix Fall Showcase with a brand new trailer. It's the best look at the game so far. Play the new demo during Steam Next FestNight Machine is joining Steam Next Fest with a fresh demo, and we think it's a big step up from anything you've played before. Jump in during th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:14:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1846018067941153","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"The Mix Fall Game Showcase!","summary":"Night Machine is in The Mix Fall Game Showcase!We’re proud to share that Night Machine will be featured in The Mix Fall Game Showcase.It’s an honor to stand alongside so many incredible indie games, and we can’t wait to show you what we’ve been building. Tune in on Youtube & Twitch Friday, October 16th, 2026, 9:00 AM Pacific | 6:00 PM CETA brand new trailer is on the way very soon, so keep an eye out. We’ll have more details on exactly when and where to watch.In the meantime, play the demo, wish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:34:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941153","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1846018067935267","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Night Machine Dev Stream","summary":"Watch the devs of Night Machine play Night Machine!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T03:16:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935267","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1845383656396509","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest has begun!!!","summary":"Hey there trainee, *feeds the VHS player* \"Playtest initiated.\"We need you to help us improve Night Machine! Join our playtest and help us with feedback, input and suggestions. If you haven't already, jump over to our discord and join the conversation. https://discord.gg/yfPPqv5JMP","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T13:56:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1842212951298263","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Night Machine Demo - v0.6","summary":"Hey, Night Machine devs here. We just released another update to the Night Machine demo:Mod Shop Tech Tree We've fully redesigned the mod shop, added a bunch more mods, and changed it to work more like a true tech tree. It gives you a lot more stuff to spend that tasty helium on.Environmental Events Some nodes now have random environmental events active, like Dusty or Heat Warning, which each change the dynamics of the fight in a specific way.Armor and Card UpdatesWe've multiplied all armor valu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T22:12:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1836506165545855","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"update","title":"New Night Machine demo update available now!","summary":"We've got another demo update ready for you, and this one's packed with additions to the core experience.Ornaments The big new feature this patch. After certain combat encounters, you'll earn ornaments that attach to your ship's windshield. They come in different rarities and carry passive modifiers that stay active for your entire run, things like \"if your shields are at 0, increase damage by 50%.\" You'll collect a handful over the course of a run, but they don't carry over between runs, so eac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T13:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165545855","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1833968530889514","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Night Machine in Strategems!","summary":"Hey pilots,In case you hadn't noticed we're part of Stratagems, a digital event focused on replayable strategy games. Kinda like Night Machine! Huge shoutout to Goblinz Publishing for hosting the event and including us! Check it out, there's tons of great games and demos taking part.If you're coming here from Stratagems, welcome! Check out our demo here!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T21:30:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1831432155577970","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Big updates to the Night Machine Demo!","summary":"Hello everyone!To celebrate Deckbuilders Fest we have released a bunch of big updates to the Night Machine demo. But, before we start off, let us just mention that we’ve added dedicated sections in our Discord where you can chat to the devs, report bugs and help us improve the overall experience. Join us here. Now to the juicy stuff, check out our Video Dev Diary, or read the changelog below: Here’s a rundown of all the updates:Conveyor belt card dealing: Cards now get dealt into your hand from ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T16:29:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1825727806711438","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"A bunch of demo updates and some fun news!","summary":"Hello everyone!We recently made some changes and updates to the Night Machine demo, check them out below:Added expanded orientation, with additional VOYou now also get a practice battle as part of the tutorial, it should now be easier to get into the game! We’ve also added a voice line for “Game Over”, you will probably encounter it sooner rather than later🙂A new pre-fight enemy overview for each encounterYou can now overview weapons and cards that the enemies will use as well as their basic sta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-27T16:48:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806711438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1818752592121271","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates","summary":"Demo Updates We've made some changes to the demo recently, here's a quick overview of what we added: Mod Shop RedesignedWe fully redesigned the mod shop, and it now acts more like a tech tree with dependencies and intentional upgrade paths. Lots more mods are planned in the near future.Card Info Screen ImprovedThe card info screen now lists and describes specific abilities of a selected card, and also includes a symbol key for any icons that appear in the card description. Added Operating Manual","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-10T16:32:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592121271","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1815580768390612","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Night Machine demo now live!","summary":"The Night Machine demo is officially live, and it's available to download and play for free! What's in the demo?Orientation and the first sector of gameplay2 playable ships60 cards and 15 equippable weapon systemsAbout Night MachineThe moon has split open, exposing an alien megafactory within. Your mission: Pilot a ramshackle ship to its core and shut it down. Just one catch... it can only be controlled with cards. Build synergies, adapt in real-time, and save Earth from the Night Machine before","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-10T13:01:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768390612","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1809235871624726","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest signups now open!","summary":"Playtest signups are now open for Night Machine! Good news everyone, playtests signups are open! Click Request Access on the Night Machine Steam page to join the playtest queue. We will be accepting requests on a rolling basis, and you'll receive an email from Steam as soon as you've been granted access. Once accepted, you'll also be able to invite up to 3 of your friends to join the playtest immediately, so you can compare notes. We're looking forward to letting the first group of players try o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-29T16:37:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809235871624726","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2974540-1809235871562128","game_id":"steam-2974540","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest opening soon!","summary":"Hi everyone! Night Machine will begin accepting requests for access from playtesters later this week! We'll approve players for access on a rolling basis.Player feedback is essential to make a great game, and we're excited to hear what you have to say.Come join our Discord while you're waiting and say hi! Night Machine Discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-27T18:54:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809235871562128","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2974540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2974540":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2974540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z"},"3809970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2974540","app_id":297